                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Get_Current_Contacts_on_Account</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Yes, current account exists</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>05/22/26 (BW) – Update path for Account_Number_of_Contacts DLRS replacement. Fires when AccountId changes. Synchronous path recalculates the prior Account&apos;s contact count; async path recalculates the current Account&apos;s contact count. 05/26/26 (BW) – Fixed null-AccountId gap: removed NotEqualTo condition from Did_Account_Change (Flow evaluates null NotEqualTo value as false, causing the prior Account to be skipped when AccountId is cleared). Now only checks that a prior Account existed.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
